stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NewSession
    NewSession --> Active: First employee message
    Active --> Answered: Assistant answers safely
    Answered --> Active: Employee asks follow-up
    Active --> HandoverOffered: Assistant cannot answer safely
    HandoverOffered --> Active: Employee declines or continues with AI
    HandoverOffered --> HandoverOpen: Employee accepts
    HandoverOpen --> HROperating: HR admin replies
    HROperating --> HandoverOpen: Employee responds
    HandoverOpen --> Resolved: HR closes or resolves case
    Active --> Deleted: Employee deletes session
    Resolved --> [*]
    Deleted --> [*]

